WEBVTT

00:00:29.572 --> 00:00:31.888
Do you spend hours
reading productivity hacks,

00:00:31.912 --> 00:00:34.158
trying new frameworks
and testing new apps

00:00:34.182 --> 00:00:35.498
to get even more done?

00:00:35.522 --> 00:00:38.263
I've tried them all --
task apps, calendar apps,

00:00:38.287 --> 00:00:39.486
time-management apps,

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:41.478
things that are meant to manage your day.

00:00:41.502 --> 00:00:43.908
We've been so obsessed with doing more

00:00:43.932 --> 00:00:45.988
that we've missed
the most important thing.

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:48.228
Many of these tools aren't helping.

00:00:48.252 --> 00:00:50.018
They're making things worse.

00:00:50.042 --> 00:00:52.700
OK, let's talk about
productivity for a second.

00:00:53.033 --> 00:00:55.771
Historically, productivity
as we know it today

00:00:55.795 --> 00:00:58.008
was used during the industrial revolution.

00:00:58.032 --> 00:01:01.788
It was a system that measured performance
based on consistent output.